  "summary": "CRC outreach worklist 'Okafor CRC 2026' (grp-okafor-crc, 5 members) worked per RBC-QM-02.\n\n| Patient | Age at end of 2026 | Status | Reason |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| pt-0009 Elly Trantow | 72 | Open gap: FIT kit ordered (sr-t0001), outreach sent (comm-t0005) | No qualifying screening on record. She takes donepezil, but her only Frailty entry (cond-00189) was marked entered in error (Dr. Lin's message comm-00301). That means the frailty plus advanced illness exclusion does not apply. No hospice, nursing home or colorectal cancer. |\n| pt-0020 Kelsie Rohan | 52 | Excluded | Hospice episode eoc-00002 ran 06/16/2026 to 08/21/2026 (finished) for pancreatic cancer. It falls in the measurement period. Revoking hospice for a clinical trial (outside summary doc-00402) does not change this. No order, no contact. |\n| pt-0022 Tiny Koss | 52 | Open gap: FIT kit ordered (sr-t0002), outreach sent (comm-t0006) | Corrected report obs-01732: the FIT sample was collected 12/31/2025. 01/05/2026 was the date the lab received it. So the test falls outside 2026, and there is no other qualifying screening. |\n| pt-0024 Delaine MacGyver | 51 | Open gap: FIT kit ordered (sr-t0003), outreach sent (comm-t0007) | The lab withdrew her 06/11/2024 stool DNA (sDNA-FIT) result (obs-01871 entered in error): the specimen belonged to another patient (doc-00401). The 2025 colonoscopy order sr-00003 is still active but was never done, so it doesn't count. No exclusions. |\n| pt-0073 Marisol Quintero | 58 | Open gap: FIT kit ordered (sr-t0004), outreach sent (comm-t0008) | Original 2026 FIT report obs-73001 was cancelled. The re-issued report obs-05001 shows the sample was collected 12/28/2025, outside 2026. No other screening or exclusions. |\n\nNotes:\n- All FIT orders run 2026-10-23 to 2026-12-31. None of these patients already had an active FIT order.\n- Patient messages say the kit is on its way and explain how to collect and return it by 12/31/2026. They say nothing about past results.\n- Search results were out of date compared with the records themselves. Several corrections arrived at 08:00 today: comm-00301, doc-00401, doc-00402, doc-00403, obs-01732 and obs-05001. All five decisions are based on the current records, read directly.\n- Closed the 5 arrival inbox items (inbox-a0001 to a0005), each with a comment and links to the order and message. No further arrivals came in before finishing.\n- I left all unrelated inbox items alone.",
